card.statement:
Let $A$ be $k[\gl,\alpha]$. The category ${_{A}}{\cC(\h,\Omega)^{loc}}$ has a monoidal grading by the group $\gl^\di/(\gl+\gl^\ort)$:

\begin{equation}
{_{A}}{\cC(\h,\Omega)^{loc}} = \bigoplus_{X\in \gl^\di/(\gl+\gl^\ort)}{_{A}}{\cC(\h,\Omega)_X^{loc}},
\end{equation}

where the category ${_{A}}{\cC(\h,\Omega)_X^{loc}}$ is the full subcategory of ${_{A}}{\cC(\h,\Omega)^{loc}}$, consisting of modules $M$ with support $X$ (or rather the corresponding $\gl$-orbit in $Hom(\gl,\Z)$).
